UNIT METER KN

* Moving-load grammar: DEFINE MOVING LOAD / TYPE n LOAD … DISTANCE … [WIDTH …]; LOAD GENERATION n / TYPE t x y z XINC|ZINC increment
* Mapping: Xd → +X, Zd → +Z, Yd → +Y, origin (0, 0, 0) m, rotation 0°

* V1 | IRC Class A | 554 kN | IRC:6-2017 Cl. 204.3, Fig. 2, Table 2
* Definition 1 — vehicle centreline; datum Axle 1 (27 kN) line, vehicle centreline.
* 8 loads, 7 inter-load distances.
DEFINE MOVING LOAD
TYPE 1 LOAD 27 27 114 114 68 68 68 68 DISTANCE 1.1 3.2 1.2 4.3 3 3 3 WIDTH 2.3
LOAD 100 LOADTYPE LIVE TITLE IRC MOVING LOAD V1
* 20 positions, 1 m increments, +Xd, reference = first load of definition 1.
LOAD GENERATION 20
TYPE 1 3.6 0 2.25 XINC 1

* V2 | IRC Class 70R (wheeled) | 1000 kN | IRC:6-2017 Cl. 204.1, Fig. 1
* Definition 3 — vehicle centreline; datum Axle 1 (80 kN) line, vehicle centreline.
* 7 loads, 6 inter-load distances.
DEFINE MOVING LOAD
TYPE 3 LOAD 80 120 120 170 170 170 170 DISTANCE 3.96 1.52 2.13 1.37 3.05 1.37 WIDTH 2.9
LOAD 101 LOADTYPE LIVE TITLE IRC MOVING LOAD V2
* 20 positions, 1 m increments, +Xd, reference = first load of definition 3.
LOAD GENERATION 20
TYPE 3 3.3 0 -2.25 XINC 1

